issue_body:
```
CREATE TABLE t (a text);
INSERT INTO t (a) VALUES ('1');
ALTER TABLE t ADD COLUMN b text;
INSERT INTO t (a, b) VALUES ('1', '2');
ALTER TABLE t SET (number_of_replicas=2);
SELECT * FROM sys.shards;
```

The new replicas will be UNASSIGNED because the transaction log will fail to index the second document.

