issue_body:
### Redis version

7.4.2

### Redisson version

3.47.0

### Redisson configuration

Add to env variables
```
REDISSON_SENTINEL_SERVERS_CONFIG_SENTINEL_ADDRESSES=redis:/host:6379
REDISSON_SENTINEL_SERVERS_CONFIG_MASTER_NAME=master
```


### What is the Expected behavior?

Sentinel server configuration have to be created.

### What is the Actual behavior?

An error 
```

Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException: Cannot invoke "org.redisson.config.SentinelServersConfig.setMasterName(String)" because "builderGetSentinelServersConfig" is null
	at org.redisson.micronaut.$RedissonConfiguration$Definition.inject(Unknown Source)
	at org.redisson.micronaut.$RedissonConfiguration$Definition.instantiate(Unknown Source)
	at io.micronaut.context.DefaultBeanContext.resolveByBeanFactory(DefaultBeanContext.java:2330)
	... 131 common frames omitted
```

### Additional information

I suppose the problem is here https://github.com/redisson/redisson/commit/66eca94e340b3816790b94d92136862969611066
Because in the constructor we are getting "sentinel" property entry not a "sentinel-servers-config"

```
 @Inject
    public RedissonConfiguration(PropertySourcePropertyResolver propertyResolver) {
        Collection<String> m = propertyResolver.getPropertyEntries("redisson");
        if (m.contains("cluster-servers-config")) {
            useClusterServers();
        }
        if (m.contains("single-server-config")) { 
            useSingleServer();
        }
        if (m.contains("replicated-servers-config")) {
            useReplicatedServers();
        }
        if (m.contains("sentinel-servers-config")) { // <<<---- doesn't work because from environment variables we get .._SENTINEL_... ("sentinel")
            useSentinelServers();
        }
```

